				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=16085&amp;sid=5c815c244c9761093f5533d5314227e5#16085"><img src="templates/Classic/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Fri Sep 24, 2004 12:52 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: The Darkest Road</span></td>
