			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I've been working on a longer story offline for abit and wanted to start posting the installments here to share with you guys. I hope you enjoy this one. <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="Smile" border="0" /> It's called "The Darkest Road" and is not so much an in game roleplay as a story that uses the characters/places of Norrath for a setting.<div style="vertical-align: bottom"><br /><br /><br />_________________<br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=956867" target="_blank" class="postlink">~Sriani HeartofWolf~</a>
